==Battleground==
*1 [[Zyclone]] spawns as the boss after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Cosmic Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
With all Anti-Starred Alien Treasures (up to [[Cats of the Cosmos|CotC]] 3), the [[Super Cosmic Cyclone]] is a non-threat, being easily taken care of by [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] and supporting damage dealers e.g. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], potentially before the [[Zyclone]] even gets a chance to spawn. If you are unable to destroy the base before the Zyclone spawns just bring standard Zyclone counters (primarily [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] as it can cc Zyclone while the Super Cosmic Cyclone is held off by catellite).

Otherwise, assuming attempting with only CotC 2 Treasures, the stage should be doable stacking Alien cc units who either outrange the [[Super Cosmic Cyclone]] (e.g. [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psycho Cat]]), and/or are immune to warp (e.g. a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]]) along with [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cats]] to deal with the [[Zyclone]] once it spawns.

